  <section class="service-deep-dives" id="house-clearance-details">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="section-head">
        <div class="section-kicker">House Clearance Service</div>
        <h2>What our Bromley house clearance team handles</h2>
        <p>Whether you are preparing a property for sale, clearing an end-of-tenancy flat, managing a probate clearance or decluttering before a move, our team takes care of all the lifting and disposal.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="deep-dive-grid">
        <article class="deep-dive-card">
          <div class="section-kicker">What We Clear</div>
          <h3>Rooms, furniture, appliances &amp; loft clutter</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>Sofas, armchairs, beds, wardrobes, tables, carpets and general household contents</li>
            <li>Mattresses (single £30, double £40, above double £50) and white goods (fridges/fridge freezers from £65)</li>
            <li>Loft, basement, garage, conservatory and garden clearances in one visit</li>
            <li>End-of-tenancy, pre-sale and sensitive probate clearances</li>
          </ul>
          <p><strong>Not collected:</strong> asbestos, toxic chemicals, wet paint, hazardous gas canisters or clinical waste.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="deep-dive-card">
          <div class="section-kicker">Transparent Pricing</div>
          <h3>What affects your house clearance price</h3>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Load volume:</strong> Quarter load £125 · Half load £250 · Three-quarter load £350 · Full load £425 (minimum charge from £40)</li>
            <li><strong>Specialist disposal items:</strong> Single mattress £30 · Double mattress £40 · Above double £50 · Tyres £15 · Gas bottles £15 · Fridges &amp; fridge freezers from £65</li>
            <li><strong>Included as standard:</strong> All labour, loading, sweep-up, parking and congestion charges — no skip permit required</li>
          </ul>
          <a class="btn btn-outline" href="/pricing">See Full Price Guide</a>
        </article>

        <article class="deep-dive-card">
          <div class="section-kicker">Access &amp; Preparation</div>
          <h3>What access we need on collection day</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>Let James know if the property is a flat, has narrow stairs, loft ladders or restricted driveway parking</li>
            <li>No need to drag heavy items outside — our team loads from inside every room</li>
            <li>Set aside any items you want to keep so the team clears only what is agreed</li>
            <li>Same-day and next-day slots regularly available across BR1, BR2, BR3, BR4, BR5, BR6 and BR7</li>
          </ul>
        </article>

        <article class="deep-dive-card">
          <div class="section-kicker">Fastest Quote Route</div>
          <h3>Which photos to send James on WhatsApp</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>1–2 wide photos of each room, loft, garage or pile to be cleared</li>
            <li>Close-up of any mattresses, fridges, tyres or heavy/bulky items</li>
            <li>A quick note of your postcode, floor level and ideal collection day</li>
          </ul>
          <a class="btn btn-primary" data-track-placement="page_body" href="https://wa.me/447931935833?text=Hi%20All%20Junk%20Solutions%2C%20I%27d%20like%20a%20Bromley%20house%20clearance%20quote.%20My%20postcode%20is%3A%20" rel="noopener" target="_blank">WhatsApp Photos to 07931 935 833</a>
